# On Home, alice's other device asks the agent something: its answer comes unread (the row bold, its dot); the chat
# opened, the app tells the core it is read at its end (client.focus) and the station marks it so.
timeout 90000
until 端到端测试
log do: peer send 再问一次 post:这一条应当显示为未读 {T}
until =这一条应当显示为未读 {T}
shot 1-unread
log do: reads
# (the command beside the run reads the station before the chat is opened)
wait 1500
tap =这一条应当显示为未读 {T}
untiln 2 这一条应当显示为未读 {T}
# (the read mark goes from the core to the station: outside the app)
wait 4000
shot 2-read
log do: reads
# (the command beside the run reads it)
wait 1500
tap icon:chevron-left
shot 3-home-read
